	(text "Page 10 of the flash datasheet specifies that the SCK line must not be toggled while CS is high.\nFor this reason, separate SCK lines have been used, along with a pulldown resistor for the flash SCK.\n\nIt also says that CS must be pulled high when the device is not in use, otherwise the \ndevice will remain in the read state which could cause damage."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 66.548 76.454 0)
		(effects
